  "changes": [
    "Use native Buffer, timingSafeEqual and P1363 signatures; remove all runtime dependencies.",
    "Require canonical signature encoding and matching algorithm/key families and EC curves.",
    "Retain JSON input coercion; add exact byte views, native key import options and CryptoKeys.",
    "Prepare immutable native key operations in WeakMaps and cache at most 16 complete public PEM strings, each at most 16 KiB; no private-PEM or mutable-buffer cache.",
    "Reject non-extractable CryptoKey conversion; native runtime restrictions remain in force.",
    "Avoid redundant RSA modulus metadata on ordinary PKCS#1 verification; retain explicit PSS lengths and bounded oversized-signature decoding. Canonical base64url uses exact native decode/encode round trips."
  ],
